OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry bright day
OL,6,Fwith plenty of sunshine developing,
OL,7,Falong with some areas of cloud
OL,8,Fespecially in the morning. A moderate
OL,9,Feasterly breeze, strong over Kintyre
OL,10,Fand the Isles.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening and
OL,13,Fnight with mostly clear skies. Frost
OL,14,Fwill become widespread on the
OL,15,Fmainland, while the Isles will be
OL,16,Fmilder through breezy.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FAnother dry day with some long
OL,19,Fsunny spells for most though the far
OL,20,Fwest will turn cloudier later. Cold
OL,21,Fwith some frost early and late inland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
