OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreading east on Tuesday with snow on
OL,7,Fhigher ground for a time. Rain dying
OL,8,Fout on Wednesday then mainly dry on
OL,9,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
